---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { download } from "../data/product";
---

<BaseLayout title="The Transmogrifier — A good image, beautifully delivered.">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The image finishing tool / For macOS</p>
      <h1 class="display">Less weight.<br /><em>More image.</em></h1>
      <p class="body-copy">
        For the images you’ve spent time getting right. Resize, compress, and
        export them for the web, with a clear view of every detail.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href={download} class="button"
          >Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        ><a href="#in-the-app" class="quiet-link"
          >Take a closer look <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="micro hero-footnote">
        V1.2.0 · Apple notarized · Entirely on your Mac
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-art">
      <div class="specimen-top micro">
        <span>Image study / No. 01</span><span>1536 × 1024 px</span>
      </div>
      <div class="specimen-image">
        <img
          src="/images/anthurium.webp"
          srcset="/images/anthurium-480.webp 480w, /images/anthurium-960.webp 960w, /images/anthurium.webp 1536w"
          sizes="(max-width: 899px) 100vw, 48vw"
          width="1536"
          height="1024"
          alt="A sculptural red anthurium and cobalt glass vase, casting a botanical shadow across a peach backdrop."
          fetchpriority="high"
        /><span class="specimen-stamp" aria-hidden="true"
          >Made<br /><em>lighter.</em><span>↙</span></span>
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        <span>Anthurium, in good form.</span><span class="micro"
          >PNG → WEBP</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <div class="format-strip wrap">
    <span class="micro">A better way from here to there</span><p>
      JPG <span>·</span> PNG <span>·</span> HEIC <span>·</span> TIFF <span
        class="format-arrow">⟶</span
      > WebP <span>·</span> JPG <span>·</span> PNG
    </p><a href="/features/#formats" class="micro">All formats ↗</a>
  </div>
  <section class="section wrap" id="in-the-app">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <p class="section-label"><span>01</span> A closer look</p><div>
        <h2 class="section-heading">
          The last step.<br /><em>Worth getting right.</em>
        </h2><p class="body-copy intro-copy">
          Your composition is done. Now make the files fit. See the original and
          export together, tune the balance, and send the whole batch on its
          way.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="app-figure">
      <div class="app-stage">
        <a
          href="/images/app-preview.webp"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="Open full-size app screenshot in a new tab"
          ><img
            src="/images/app-preview.webp"
            width="1054"
            height="768"
            loading="lazy"
            alt="The Transmogrifier live preview showing the botanical PNG at 2.2 MB and its WebP preview at 67 KB, with a 200 KB file-size limit."
          /></a>
      </div><figcaption>
        <a
          href="/images/app-preview.webp"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="micro">The actual app / View full size ↗</a
        ><span
          >2.2 MB → 67 KB <span class="result-note">in this example</span
          ></span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="detail-row">
      <div>
        <span class="micro">01 / Look closely</span><h3>
          Keep your eye on the image.
        </h3><p>
          Live encoded previews, a comparison wipe, and 100% zoom. Choose the
          balance with your eyes open.
        </p>
      </div><div>
        <span class="micro">02 / Set the limit</span><h3>
          Give every file a budget.
        </h3><p>
          Choose a file-size ceiling and minimum quality. If a file cannot fit,
          you’ll know before it goes out.
        </p>
      </div><div>
        <span class="micro">03 / Keep it yours</span><h3>
          Everything stays on your Mac.
        </h3><p>
          Your images, your folders, your workflow. Local processing, with no
          uploads or account required.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/features/" class="text-link"
      >Meet the whole toolkit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
    >
  </section>
  <section class="pack-section">
    <div class="wrap pack-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label"><span>02</span> A considered handoff</p><h2
          class="section-heading"
        >
          One image.<br /><em>Every place it goes.</em>
        </h2><p class="body-copy">
          A smaller screen. A bigger display. A JPG fallback, just in case.
          Export a family of WebP sizes together and copy the srcset when you’re
          done.
        </p><a href="/docs/#responsive" class="text-link"
          >Build your first image pack <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div><div class="pack-study">
        <div class="pack-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="print print-large">
            <img
              src="/images/anthurium-960.webp"
              width="960"
              height="640"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
            /><span class="micro">1280w / WebP</span>
          </div><div class="print print-small">
            <img
              src="/images/anthurium-480.webp"
              width="480"
              height="320"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
            /><span class="micro">640w / WebP</span>
          </div>
        </div><div class="pack-caption micro">
          <span>Illustrated responsive image pack</span><span
            >↳ Sized to fit.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap routine">
    <p class="section-label"><span>03</span> Less repetition</p><div>
      <h2 class="section-heading">
        Find your settings.<br /><em>Keep your rhythm.</em>
      </h2><ul class="routine-list">
        <li>
          <span class="micro">Save</span><div>
            <h3>A recipe for the next time.</h3><p>
              Format, quality, widths, naming, destination. Save the whole setup
              as a preset.
            </p>
          </div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </li><li>
          <span class="micro">Repeat</span><div>
            <h3>Your history has a future.</h3><p>
              Find a batch, reuse its settings, or pick up the exports you
              didn’t finish.
            </p>
          </div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </li><li>
          <span class="micro">Go</span><div>
            <h3>At home on your Mac.</h3><p>
              Keyboard shortcuts and optional Dock conversion keep familiar work
              moving.
            </p>
          </div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </li>
      </ul><a href="/docs/#presets" class="text-link"
        >Make it part of your process <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap endnote">
    <p class="section-label"><span>Colophon</span> Why it exists</p><div>
      <p>
        Good image work deserves a good handoff. The Transmogrifier is an
        independent tool by Clear pH, built for the everyday work between a
        finished design and a finished website.
      </p><a href="/changelog/" class="text-link"
        >What’s new in 1.2 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.06fr 1fr;
    gap: 55px;
    padding-block: 54px 50px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-copy {
    padding-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    margin: 36px 0 30px;
    font-size: clamp(78px, 8.15vw, 128px);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .hero .body-copy {
    max-width: 390px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .quiet-link {
    font-size: 12px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    padding: 10px 0;
  }
  .quiet-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero-footnote {
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .hero-art {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .specimen-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .specimen-image {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1.075;
    background: #e9ac91;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .specimen-image > img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 40% 50%;
    animation: picture-arrive 1s ease-out both;
  }
  .specimen-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    right: 20px;
    bottom: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 113px;
    height: 113px;
    background: var(--paper);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    font: 27px/0.9 var(--serif);
    transform: rotate(10deg);
  }
  .specimen-stamp > span {
    font: 27px/1 var(--sans);
    margin-top: 7px;
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .hero-art figcaption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 13px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .hero-art figcaption .micro {
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .format-strip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 24px 0;
  }
  .format-strip > p {
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .format-strip > p > span {
    color: #7f8073;
  }
  .format-strip > p > .format-arrow {
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-inline: 8px;
  }
  .format-strip a:hover {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .intro-copy {
    margin-top: 26px;
  }
  .app-stage {
    background: #dfdfd4;
    padding: 50px 65px;
  }
  .app-stage img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1054px;
    margin: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 40px -25px #29292370;
  }
  .app-figure figcaption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 17px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .result-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-left: 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .detail-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 50px;
    margin: 55px 0 35px;
  }
  .detail-row .micro {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .detail-row h3 {
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin: 16px 0 12px;
  }
  .detail-row p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .pack-section {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 90px 0;
  }
  .pack-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 95px;
  }
  .pack-section .section-heading {
    margin: 33px 0 25px;
  }
  .pack-section .section-heading em {
    color: #dcaf89;
  }
  .pack-section .section-label span:first-child {
    color: #dcaf89;
  }
  .pack-section .body-copy {
    color: #bdbdb0;
    max-width: 370px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .pack-section .text-link {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .pack-section .text-link:hover {
    color: #dcaf89;
  }
  .pack-visual {
    position: relative;
    padding: 15px 0 65px 55px;
  }
  .print {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 10px 10px 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px #0002;
  }
  .print img {
    aspect-ratio: 1.15;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 40%;
  }
  .print .micro {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .print-large {
    width: 90%;
    transform: rotate(5deg);
  }
  .print-small {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 47%;
    transform: rotate(-7deg);
  }
  .pack-caption {
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: #bdbdb0;
    gap: 18px;
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .routine {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 60px;
  }
  .routine-list {
    margin-top: 45px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .routine-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr 20px;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 27px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .routine-list .micro {
    color: var(--red);
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .routine-list h3 {
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .routine-list p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    max-width: 430px;
  }
  .routine .text-link {
    margin-top: 25px;
  }
  .endnote {
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }
  @keyframes picture-arrive {
    from {
      opacity: 0.5;
      transform: scale(1.035);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1600px) {
    .hero {
      gap: 90px;
      padding-block: 75px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 140px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .hero {
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 8.4vw;
    }
    .format-strip {
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .format-strip > p {
      font-size: 16px;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .format-strip > .micro {
      max-width: 135px;
    }
    .detail-row {
      gap: 30px;
    }
    .pack-layout {
      gap: 50px;
    }
    .app-stage {
      padding: 40px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 45px;
      padding-top: 45px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(78px, 13vw, 120px);
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
    .hero .body-copy {
      max-width: 440px;
    }
    .specimen-image {
      aspect-ratio: 1.5;
    }
    .hero-art {
      max-width: 680px;
      width: 100%;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
    .format-strip > p {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .format-strip > a {
      display: none;
    }
    .detail-row {
      gap: 25px;
    }
    .pack-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
    }
    .pack-section .body-copy {
      max-width: 460px;
    }
    .pack-study {
      width: min(510px, 100%);
      margin-left: auto;
    }
    .routine {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 25px;
    }
    .app-stage {
      padding: 25px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 599px) {
    .hero {
      gap: 35px;
      padding-block: 36px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(62px, 15.4vw, 90px);
      margin: 28px 0 24px;
    }
    .hero .eyebrow {
      font-size: 9px;
      gap: 9px;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      gap: 12px 24px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .button {
      padding: 13px 18px;
      gap: 25px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .hero-footnote {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .specimen-stamp {
      width: 83px;
      height: 83px;
      font-size: 22px;
      right: 15px;
      bottom: 15px;
    }
    .specimen-stamp > span {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
    .specimen-top {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .hero-art figcaption {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .format-strip {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    .format-strip > .micro {
      max-width: none;
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .format-strip > p {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      font-size: 15px;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .format-strip > p > .format-arrow {
      font-size: 23px;
      margin: 0 3px;
    }
    .section-intro {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .app-stage {
      padding: 16px 12px;
      margin-inline: -8px;
    }
    .app-stage img {
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .app-figure figcaption {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 7px;
    }
    .app-figure figcaption .micro {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .detail-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 26px;
      margin: 35px 0 22px;
    }
    .detail-row > div {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 22px;
    }
    .detail-row h3 {
      margin: 12px 0 8px;
    }
    .pack-section {
      padding: 64px 0;
    }
    .pack-visual {
      padding-left: 35px;
    }
    .pack-caption {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
    .routine-list li {
      grid-template-columns: 45px 1fr 14px;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .routine-list h3 {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
    .routine-list .micro {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .endnote {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
  }
</style>
